            <p class="hero-copy">
              Discover elevated everyday pieces, limited-time offers, and thoughtful stories that help you style every room with ease.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-cta">
              <button class="primary-btn" type="button">Explore collection</button>
              <button class="ghost-btn" type="button">See today's deals</button>
            </div>
